flowchart TB
    subgraph BP[Brain 进程 A]
        B[runBrain<br/>先 echo，再 wait]
        I[Executor.Call<br/>统一调用接口]
        L[LocalExecutor<br/>本地模式]
        LT[executeTool<br/>本进程工具]
        R[RemoteExecutor + client<br/>Brain 内的远程代理]
        B --> I
        I -->|启动时选择| L
        L --> LT
        I -->|启动时选择| R
    end
    subgraph GP[Gateway 进程]
        GA[pairRoute A<br/>鉴权与在线转发<br/>当前连接 + epoch]
        GB[pairRoute B<br/>独立状态与锁]
    end
    subgraph EP[Executor 进程 A]
        E[client + executorEndpoint<br/>接收调用、持有执行槽]
        T[executeTool<br/>echo / wait]
        E --> T
    end
    BB[Brain 进程 B<br/>同一份代码，pair=B]
    EB[Executor 进程 B<br/>同一份代码，pair=B]
    R <-->|WS：Brain 主动拨号| GA
    GA <-->|WS：Executor 主动拨号| E
    BB <-->|WS| GB
    GB <-->|WS| EB
    classDef decision fill:#eaf2ff,stroke:#3566ae,color:#162d4d
    classDef routing fill:#fff2d9,stroke:#ae7b25,color:#4c350f
    classDef execution fill:#e9f6ed,stroke:#398251,color:#183c23
    class B,I,R,BB decision
    class GA,GB routing
    class L,LT,E,T,EB execution
